Z||000011||Hank is Here||10-29-2001||05:18 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by rogergarrison:<BR><B> <BR>those totally bombed too, you can buy one now if its still runs for $100. Only thing worse was the Olds gas engines converted over to diesels.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>The olds 350 diesels wern't that bad at all, as far as internal s were concerned.  GM was cheap by converting a gas bolck to a diesel but it worked, granted.  The screw up was the fuel system, it was pratically a gas system you poured diesel into.  All the debris ate the injection pumps alive. <BR>||||reg||1
